      <title>人保寿险保费跌5.9%垫底，新华两年增31.1%领跑</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E4%BA%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%AF%BF%E9%99%A9%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%B9%E8%B7%8C5.9%E5%9E%AB%E5%BA%95%E6%96%B0%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%A4%E5%B9%B4%E5%A2%9E31.1%E9%A2%86%E8%B7%91/</link>
